rce Artifacts\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-beta-runtime-source-map.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-beta-display-diagnostic-posture-map.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-beta-visual-required-inventory.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-usage-figureasset-priority-queue.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/text-only-runtime-smoke-readback.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-blocked-runtime-smoke-readback.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/source-figure-asset-candidates.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/source-figure-asset-rights-display-policy.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/source-visual-receipt-replay-validator.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-wave1-runtime-readiness-delta.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-b0-b1-local-rehearsal-receipt.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-beta-source-map.v1.json`\n\n## Headline Metrics\n- Full beta universe: 3530 rows.\n- Text-only attemptable: 2672 / 3530 rows.\n- Visual-required blocked: 858 / 3530 rows.\n- Visual-blocked local smoke hits: 4 events; not production telemetry.\n- Diagnostic suppression: 3530 / 3530 rows remain routing/logging/review-queue-only.\n- Evidence unavailable: 3530 / 3530 rows.\n- Rights display blockers: 858 / 858 visual-required rows.\n- VLM candidate backlog: 833 / 858 rows; candidate output rows remain 0.\n- Candidate QA no-auth posture: 858 / 858 visual-required rows.\n- Supabase local rehearsal imported: 3530 / 3530 rows; remote mutation is false.\n\n## Caveats / No-Claim Boundaries\n- Uses bounded local artifacts and snapshots only.\n- Does not use production telemetry.\n- Does not perform remote Supabase mutation, DB push, storage upload, or HTTP write probe.\n- Does not perform external VLM calls.\n- Does not claim launch ready, official scoring ready, rights approved, student-display-final, Phase B2 ready, or SourceVisualReceipt approved.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (required first command): exit 0; warning only for AO-created branch naming.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/method-map/__tests__/full-beta-observability-dashboard.test.js --verbose`: 3 tests passed.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-observability-dashboard.mjs --check`: validator pass; generated artifacts match checked-in files.\n- `npm run quality:report-index`: pass; no added report markdown and zero violations.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-observability-dashboard.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/full-beta-observability-dashboard.test.js`: exit 0.\n- `git diff --check`: exit 0.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (post-commit): exit 0; warnings only for branch naming and one local commit ahead before push.\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:46:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:48:23Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T15:48:20Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T15:48:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"240c0bc1febb9da83cd72fa691d1260aed8ff16d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1237/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1237/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1237/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/c0986a971b1b667e69dfeaa108f5d2fbeaa318dc","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1206","ref":"feat/issue-1206","sha":"c0986a971b1b667e69dfeaa108f5d2fbeaa318dc","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","g